        "普通输入应完成本题指定的核心操作。"
      ],
      "experience_points": 20,
      "private": {
        "reference_solution": "import sys\nname = sys.stdin.read().strip()\nif name == '__invalid__' or (name and not name.isalpha()):\n    raise ValueError('name must contain letters only')\nprint(f'Hello, {name or \"World\"}!')\n",
        "hidden_tests": [
          "边界输入必须返回主题定义的结果。",
          "无效输入必须进入可预期的失败分支。"
