        "reference_solution": "import sys\nlines = sys.stdin.read().splitlines()\nif lines == ['__invalid__'] or len(lines) != 2 or any(not line.isalpha() for line in lines):\n    raise ValueError('two alphabetic lines required')\nprint(lines[0])\nprint(lines[1])\n",
